eight sections) into one HTML file: inline SVG line icons (no emoji), count-up
numbers, animated bars, scroll-reveal that respects prefers-reduced-motion, and
a restrained dark instrument palette. No AI-slop tropes (no side-stripe borders,
no gradient text, no glass, no generic card grid). Prints the output path.

Language: the static chrome is localized (English default, Russian available). Set
it via the analysis's "lang" field ("en" | "ru") or --lang; the model-written
content is in whatever language the analysis was authored in.

